    "detailed_description": "Originally released in 1996, <i>Actua Golf</i> brought the Actua Sports series staples of fully 3d environments, multiple cameras, motion captured player movements, and world-class commentary to the golf course. Now, relive those days in this remastered emulated version.<br><br>Compete in practice, stroke play, match play, skins, foursome, four ball challenge, amateur tour, and pro tour modes.<br><br>Features two challenging 18-hole courses to test your golfing skills.<br><br>Customize your golfer, and lead them to greatness.<br><br>Commentary provided by Peter Alliss (the &quot;Voice of Golf&quot;), Pat O'Brian and Tony Adamson.<br><br>Play with up to 4 players. By default, the game operates round-robin style, with a single controller being handed around for each player's turn. To play instead with a single controller for each player, first set the desired number of players on the main menu, then go to Controls &gt; Controller and assign a different controller to each player.<br><br><br>This enhanced version introduces a number of modern features to this retro classic, including:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Saving/loading the game at any point<br></li><li> Support for most modern game controllers<br></li><li> Full control remapping<br></li><li> Image scaling and smoothing options</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Originally released in 1996, <i>Actua Golf</i> brought the Actua Sports series staples of fully 3d environments, multiple cameras, motion captured player movements, and world-class commentary to the golf course. Now, relive those days in this remastered emulated version.<br><br>Compete in practice, stroke play, match play, skins, foursome, four ball challenge, amateur tour, and pro tour modes.<br><br>Features two challenging 18-hole courses to test your golfing skills.<br><br>Customize your golfer, and lead them to greatness.<br><br>Commentary provided by Peter Alliss (the &quot;Voice of Golf&quot;), Pat O'Brian and Tony Adamson.<br><br>Play with up to 4 players. By default, the game operates round-robin style, with a single controller being handed around for each player's turn. To play instead with a single controller for each player, first set the desired number of players on the main menu, then go to Controls &gt; Controller and assign a different controller to each player.<br><br><br>This enhanced version introduces a number of modern features to this retro classic, including:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Saving/loading the game at any point<br></li><li> Support for most modern game controllers<br></li><li> Full control remapping<br></li><li> Image scaling and smoothing options</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In this classic golf simulation game from 1996, test your golfing skills on two challenging 18-hole courses, across a variety of game modes such as foursome, four ball challenge, and skins. Customize your golfer and lead them up through amateur and pro ranks.",
